  "details": "It's a lost cause they're so bad.\n\nThey're not JUST buggy?? You need a UGC userscript so that anybody who isn't exactly 150cm tall to align properly. Actually basically nobody lines up properly.\n\nIdeas for Station 2.0\n\n- UX like BasisVR's stations; set seat length, leg angle, back angle and all that\n\n- Avatar actually aligns with the chair for once\n\n- Can have Long Chair on a Polyline or Spline that lets you sit anywhere along it (like FlekSit prefab but more with more control)\n\n- [Work with Trigger Events properly](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/stations-break-trigger-events)\n\n- option to add dedicated \"Exit Chair\" button to the Quick Menu for vehicles that use every button (so I don't have to guess what the custom bind is as it currently changes per-world)\n\n- make more reliable in general\n\nwill add more as I think of them",
